Subject: [PATCH] make native WMM configuration a per-VAP transaction

Apply each complete queue table after SET_BSS and acknowledge every
later queue update before publishing it. AP and STA callbacks share
the master serializer but retain their own configuration. Remove
legacy final-queue batching and the synthetic STA QoS trigger.

Use the existing native stop ownership when initialization fails,
and complete host teardown after terminal hardware quiesce.

